{"id": "140226", "name": "העתקות לינאריות - נ\\ל נוספים - 18", "qtype": "truefalse", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 1, "options": {}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\">\n<div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div>\n<p>עבור כל שלושה מרחבים וקטוריים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(V,W,U\\)</span> (מעל אותו שדה) והעתקות לינאריות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(T:V\\to W, S:W\\to U\\)</span>,</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\">\n<p>אם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(ST\\)</span> על <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\)</span>, אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S\\)</span> על <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\)</span>.</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"native-answer\">[[input:ans]]</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> כל ערך של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(ST\\)</span> הוא בפרט ערך של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — ההרכבה</b><br>כאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(ST\\)</span> היא ההרכבה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S\\circ T:V\\to U\\)</span>: קודם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(T\\)</span> ואחר כך <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הוכחה</b><br>יהי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u\\in U\\)</span>. <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(ST\\)</span> על, ולכן קיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\in V\\)</span> כך ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u=ST(v)=S\\big(T(v)\\big)\\)</span>. נסמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(w=T(v)\\in W\\)</span>; אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S(w)=u\\)</span>. לכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\text{Im}(S)=U\\)</span>, כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S\\)</span> על <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\)</span>.<p style=\"text-align:center\"><b>הטענה נכונה.</b></p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "radio", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": false, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "native": {"shuffle": false, "numbering": "none", "instruction": "one", "lang": "he"}}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "native": true, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": []}], "qvnames": [], "nvariants": 1}